    "body": "The approved Fleet v1 M1–M5 source update and TIP-064 are implemented under Vibecode Kit v6. Private VM/actual MT5/SDK tests remain deferred until source handover.\n\nCurrent head 154e954aa631c63c39db639aa93a529e9807f42c, tree 2d29bc02cb7fc13dabeb32c886f3fa8e3a705561, passed seven of eight workflows. Deep and Bootstrap passed the bounded positive admission/startup refinements. Integrated Linux passed 1121 tests with 14 platform skips. Integrated Windows completed 1124 passed, one failed capacity fixture, 10 skips; independent Q1 16/16, G03-A 8/8, B1 harmless 10/10 and portable 39/39 passed. Both integrated artifacts match all 206 frozen source hashes and unchanged before/after manifests.\n\nThe remaining capacity fixture reached its three-second aggregate completion observation limit. Actual terminal states were absent from the original log; investigation/refinement continues without authority/UNKNOWN relaxation. Failed and successful receipts, original ZIPs, JUnit and lossless logs are retained. All eight checks on the delivered head remain required.\n\nIncluded implementation and operator handover: docs/fleet-v1/source-handover.md, source-update-verification.md and TIP-064-operator-handbook.md. Legacy 85-tool schemas/history, default capacity-one and all physical qualification gates remain preserved. No merge/deployment/private VM/account/AutoTrading effects.",
